  "deviations": [
    "No glTF doubleSided materials at all: the only cutout material (veg_foliage_card) is single-sided MASK; where both sides must show (sprigs, twig sprays, grass) the generator emits a separate reversed back face. This keeps both sides lit consistently in Godot (no back-face normal flip) at the cost of extra triangles (counted in all budgets).",
    "Card and lobe vertex normals are intentionally bent outward from crown/lobe centres (soft volumetric shading); per-card geometric vs shading normal can differ (reported in checks/glb_inspect.json).",
    "Oak crown width is held at <= 3.8 m (hard cap) rather than using the +10% tolerance; measured max horizontal extent 3.769 m (oak_summer)."
